5f9d.mp4?t=1779827301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest hides more than predators. Something lingers in the silence, twisting what it touches and leaving nothing unchanged. Survival here is not only against the swarms you see, but against a dark corruption that spreads without end. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You may not be alone in your struggle...</h2>", "short_description": "EXOME is a co-op sci-fi survival shooter that blends wave-based survival with open-world exploration. Battle hordes of aliens, upgrade your arsenal, and uncover the hidden truths of the deep forest. Will you face it alone or bring your friends along?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/5145d72f0412fa7f7b5f2c4f4bbd4be1aef8cda6/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1779827301", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/755a6750617eaa1374ab5f363b29cfe8e9cd3fa5/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1779827301", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/755a6750617eaa1374ab5f363b29cfe8e9cd3fa5/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1779827301", "website": "https://rudefrogstudios.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 9 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requ